> A hand-checkable calculation

A model predicting state delta.5 and reward2 from state1 yields successor1.5 and reward2. CEM scoring, elites and action-sequence refits remain visible in the experiment.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mpc_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
