> Actual source model/search diagnostics

These measurements come from the complete source run above; each series retains source execution order. A bounded run or one evaluation point does not establish convergence. Model loss and task return use separate figures.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mpc_diagnostic1.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
